         MACRO ,
         PLUPRM ,
PRMSECT  DSECT ,
PRMPGMNP DS    D              CMS's PGMNEW PSW.
PRMSVCNP DS    D              CMS's SVCNEW PSW.
PRMCCPSW DS    D              SVC204 (CMSCALL) return PSW.
PRMABNEX DS    A              ABNEXIT handler.
PRMABNUW DS    F              ABNEXIT user word.
PRMPIPMD DS    A              PIPMOD address.
PRMPLUNG DS    A              PLUNGER address.
PRMFLAG1 DS    X              Flags
PRMF1DBG EQU   X'80'           - Debugging is active.
PRMF1ENA EQU   X'40'           - Are we ENABLEd?
PRMF1ABN EQU   X'20'           - PRMABNEX ABNEXIT has been invoked.
PRMF1EXS EQU   X'10'           - CMS has EXIS support.
         DS    3X
PRMS14PA DS    XL6            SPIE SVC 14 PICA.
PRMLEN   EQU   *-PRMSECT
         MEND  ,
